# "Sacrifice a land": with only a Mox Emerald (no land) the ability is not offered (refusal). With a Forest it is, the turn Safekeeper arrives (the cost has no {T}, so summoning sickness does not matter), targeting itself, and the sacrificed Forest goes
# to the graveyard. The shroud lasts "until end of turn": on turn 2 Bot2's Lightning Bolt can target the Safekeeper and kills it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Safekeeper
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Safekeeper.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Safekeeper.Activate(Sylvan Safekeeper)
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Safekeeper.Activate(Sylvan Safekeeper)
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Sylvan Safekeeper)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Sylvan Safekeeper; Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
